{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dungeon crawler where puzzles meet chaos!</strong><br>Grab your friends (up to 4-player co-op) and dive into a roguelite dungeon where every room is a unique tile-swapping puzzle packed with traps, monsters, and treasures. Work together, shout at each other, and try not to fall into the abyss!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216420/extras/c18f4e3c2d5d2b8920191c15c906a684.poster.avif?t=1772049955\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216420/extras/c18f4e3c2d5d2b8920191c15c906a684.webm?t=1772049955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216420/extras/c18f4e3c2d5d2b8920191c15c906a684.mp4?t=1772049955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Put your friendship to test with:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Co-op Action</strong> \u2013 Play solo or with up to 3 friends. Communication is key\u2026 or total chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile-Swap Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Rearrange dungeon tiles in real-time to open paths, solve riddles, and outsmart traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression</strong> \u2013 Each run is different: new rooms, new puzzles, new surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Game Energy</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to master. Perfect for couch chaos or online fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Yet Deadly</strong> \u2013 Cartoonish art style hides cunning traps, sneaky monsters, and explosive puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the cooperative mayhem of <i>Overcooked</i>, <i>Moving Out</i>, or <i>PlateUp!</i> but wish it came with dungeon-crawling puzzles and rogue-lite replayability, <i>Friendship Dungeon: Party Puzzler</i> is for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can your friendships survive the dungeon?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2216420?t=1772049955","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216420/547e38a6cc8a60edcb78d76fd8e80c5561277f44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772049955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216420/7247fe1c994b9732678ad4e422e13ad4c60072b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772049955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216420/7247fe1c994b9732678ad4e422e13ad4c60072b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772049955","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3930120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dungeon crawler where puzzles meet chaos!</strong><br>Grab your friends (up to 4-player co-op) and dive into a roguelite dungeon where every room is a unique tile-swapping puzzle packed with traps, monsters, and treasures. Work together, shout at each other, and try not to fall into the abyss!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216420/extras/c18f4e3c2d5d2b8920191c15c906a684.poster.avif?t=1772049955\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea